\par 1.\cf0   O lamb of God most Holy
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 who on the cross didst suffer
\par and patience slow and lonely
\par Yourself to scorn did offer
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par Our sins by you were taken
\par or hope had us forsaken
\par \cf1 Have mercy on us Jesus.
\par \cf0 
